"028:001 And the Lord spoke to Moses, saying,",
"028:002 Charge the children of Israel, and you shall speak to them, saying, You shall observe to offer to me in my feasts my gifts, my presents, my burnt offerings for a sweet smelling savour.",
"028:003 And you shall say to them, These are the burnt offerings, all that you shall bring to the Lord; two lambs of a year old without blemish daily, for a whole burnt offering perpetually.",
"028:004 You shall offer one lamb in the morning, and you shall offer the second lamb towards evening.",
"028:005 And you shall offer the tenth part of an ephah of fine flour for a meat-offering, mingled with oil, with the fourth part of a hin.",
"028:006 It is a perpetual whole burnt offering, a sacrifice offered in the mount of Sina for a sweet smelling savour to the Lord.",
"028:007 And its drink-offering, the fourth part of a hin to each lamb; in the holy place shall you pour strong drink as a drink-offering to the Lord.",
"028:008 And the second lamb you shall offer towards evening; you shall offer it according to its meat-offering and according to its drink-offering for a smell of sweet savour to the Lord.",
"028:009 And on the sabbath-day you shall offer two lambs of a year old without blemish, and two tenth deals of fine flour mingled with oil for a meat-offering, and a drink-offering.",
"028:010 It is a whole burnt offering of the sabbaths on the sabbath days, besides the continued whole burnt offering, and its drink offering.",
"028:011 And at the new moons you shall bring a whole burnt offering to the Lord, two calves of the herd, and one ram, seven lambs of a year old without blemish.",
"028:012 Three tenth deals of fine flour mingled with oil for one calf, and two tenth deals of fine flour mingled with oil for one ram.",
"028:013 A tenth deal of fine flour mingled with oil for each lamb, as a meat-offering, a sweet smelling savour, a burnt offering to the Lord.",
"028:014 Their drink-offering shall be the half of a hin for one calf; and the third of a hin for one ram; and the fourth part of a hin of wine for one lamb: this is the whole burnt offering monthly throughout the months of the year.",
"028:015 And he shall offer one kid of the goats for a sin-offering to the Lord; it shall be offered beside the continual whole burnt offering and its drink-offering.",
"028:016 And in the first month, on the fourteenth day of the month, is the passover to the Lord.",
"028:017 And on the fifteenth day of this month is a feast; seven days you shall eat unleavened bread.",
"028:018 And the first day shall be to you a holy convocation; you shall do no servile work.",
"028:019 And you shall bring whole burnt offerings, a sacrifice to the Lord, two calves of the herd, one ram, seven lambs of a year old; they shall be to you without blemish.",
"028:020 And their meat-offering shall be fine flour mingled with oil; three tenth deals for one calf, and two tenth deals for one ram.",
"028:021 You shall offer a tenth for each lamb, for the seven lambs.",
"028:022 And you shall offer one kid of the goats for a sin-offering, to make atonement for you.",
"028:023 Beside the perpetual whole burnt offering in the morning, which is a whole burnt sacrifice for a continuance,",
"028:024 these shall you thus offer daily for seven days, a gift, a sacrifice for a sweet smelling savour to the Lord; beside the continual whole burnt offering, you shall offer its drink-offering.",
"028:025 And the seventh day shall be to you a holy convocation; you shall do no servile work in it.",
"028:026 And on the day of the new corn, when you shall offer a new sacrifice at the festival of weeks to the Lord, there shall be to you a holy convocation; you shall do no servile work,",
"028:027 and you shall bring whole burnt offerings for a sweet smelling savour to the Lord, two calves of the herd, one ram, seven lambs without blemish.",
"028:028 Their meat-offering shall be fine flour mingled with oil; there shall be three tenth deals for one calf, and two tenth deals for one ram.",
"028:029 A tenth for each lamb separately, for the seven lambs; and a kid of the goats,",
"028:030 for a sin-offering, to make atonement for you; beside the perpetual whole burnt offering: and",
"028:031 you shall offer to me their meat-offering. They shall be to you unblemished, and you shall offer their drink-offerings."
