"033:038 And Aaron the priest went up by the command of the Lord, and died there in the fortieth year of the departure of the children of Israel from the land of Egypt, in the fifth month, on the first day of the month.",
"033:039 And Aaron was one hundred and twenty-three years old, when he died in mount Or.",
"033:040 And Arad the Chananitish king (he too lived in the land of Chanaan) having heard when the children of Israel were entering the land—",
"033:041 then they departed from mount Or, and encamped in Selmona.",
