"033:046 And they departed from Daebon Gad, and encamped in Gelmon Deblathaim.",
"033:047 And they departed from Gelmon Deblathaim, and encamped on the mountains of Abarim, over against Nabau.",
"033:048 And they departed from the mountains of Abarim, and encamped on the west of Moab, at Jordan by Jericho.",
"033:049 And they encamped by Jordan between Aesimoth, as far as Belsa to the west of Moab.",
