"033:054 And you shall inherit their land according to your tribes; to the greater number you shall give the larger possession, and to the smaller you shall give the less possession; to whatever part a man's name shall go forth by lot, there shall be his property: you shall inherit according to the tribes of your families.",
"033:055 But if you will not destroy the dwellers in the land from before you, then it shall come to pass that whoever of them you shall leave shall be thorns in your eyes, and darts in your sides, and they shall be enemies to you on the land on which you shall dwell;",
"033:056 and it shall come to pass that as I had determined to do to them, so I will do to you."
