"034:004 And your border shall go round you from the south to the ascent of Acrabin, and shall proceed by Ennac, and the going forth of it shall be southward to Cades Barne, and it shall go forth to the village of Arad, and shall proceed by Asemona.",
"034:005 And the border shall compass from Asemona to the river of Egypt, and the sea shall be the termination.",
"034:006 And you shall have your border on the west, the great sea shall be the boundary: this shall be to you the border on the west.",
"034:007 And this shall be your northern border; from the great sea you shall measure to yourselves, by the side of the mountain.",
"034:008 And you shall measure to yourselves the mountain from mount Hor at the entering in to Emath, and the termination of it shall be the coasts of Saradac.",
"034:009 And the border shall go out to Dephrona, and its termination shall be at Arsenain; this shall be your border from the north.",
