"034:012 And the border shall go down to Jordan, and the termination shall be the salt sea; this shall be your land and its borders round about.",
"034:013 And Moses charged the children of Israel, saying, This is the land which you shall inherit by lot, even as the Lord commanded us to give it to the nine tribes and the half-tribe of Manasse.",
"034:014 For the tribe of the children of Ruben, and the tribe of the children of Gad have received their inheritance according to their families; and the half-tribe of Manasse have received their inheritances.",
